    <bpmn:process id="W_W3962" name="W3962. Vendor Agreement, RPM &amp; Exclusivity Clause Review &amp; Contract Controls" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New/renewed vendor or trade agreement; clause-library change
Frequency: Per contract + maintained clause library
Volume: ~800–1,000 vendors; ~1,200 merchandise POs/month (all types ~1,600–1,900/month production-calibrated, per data-volumes §1.1; links to VS-03)
Owner: VP Legal / VP Supply Chain
Participants: Legal (links to VS-100.3), Procurement (links to VS-03), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Contract Management (links to VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W3962 — Vendor Agreement, RPM &amp; Exclusivity Clause Review &amp; Contract Controls</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3962_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3962_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3962_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3962_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3962_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3962_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3962_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3962_Start3" name="New/renewed vendor or trade agreement; clause-library change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3962_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3962_Task4" name="Legal maintain the antitrust clause library and prohibited-clause list: RPM…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal maintain the antitrust clause library and prohibited-clause list: RPM (mandatory resale price, max/min resale price, MAP enforced as price), naked exclusivity, most-favored-nation/parity where foreclosure-prone, territorial/customer restraints outside selective distribution, and tying of unrelated goods
Responsible (R): Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3962_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3962_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3962_Task5" name="Legal/Procurement review every vendor and trade agreement against the clause…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Procurement review every vendor and trade agreement against the clause library before execution (gate into VS-100.3 contract review and VS-03 vendor onboarding), flag and remediate non-compliant clauses, and document effect-based justification for any arguably-restrictive but pro-competitive clause
Responsible (R): Legal / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3962_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3962_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3962_Task6" name="Legal monitor executed agreements for drift (amendments, side letters…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal monitor executed agreements for drift (amendments, side letters, rebate/MAP enforcement that functions as RPM), and refresh the clause library on PCC guidance change
Responsible (R): Legal / Contract Mgmt
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3962_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3962_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3962_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3962_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3962_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-618 (ensure controlled execution — Anti-Competitive Conduct Prevention &amp; Compliance Controls (PA-129.2).) | - operational: clause library and review gate; operational: monitoring and audit
Owner: VP Legal / VP Supply Chain</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3962_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3962_Annotation8" targetRef="W3962_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3962_Flow10" sourceRef="W3962_Start3" targetRef="W3962_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3962_Flow11" sourceRef="W3962_Task4" targetRef="W3962_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3962_Flow12" sourceRef="W3962_Task5" targetRef="W3962_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3962_Flow13" sourceRef="W3962_Task6" targetRef="W3962_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
