    <bpmn:process id="W_W3964" name="W3964. Trade / B2B Distribution, Resale &amp; Channel Pricing Compliance Controls" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Trade-program change; resale/channel conduct question
Frequency: Maintained + on change
Volume: Trade pro program (VS-43); sari-sari/MSME (VS-82); B2B (VS-11)
Owner: VP Legal / VP Trade Sales
Participants: Legal, Trade/B2B Sales (links to VS-11), Trade Pro Program (links to VS-43), MSME (links to VS-82), Merchandising (links to VS-01)
Source: workflow W3964 — Trade / B2B Distribution, Resale &amp; Channel Pricing Compliance Controls</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3964_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3964_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3964_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3964_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3964_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3964_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3964_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3964_Start3" name="Trade-program change; resale/channel conduct question">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3964_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3964_Task4" name="Legal/Trade-Sales establish channel-pricing controls: BuildRight communicates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Trade-Sales establish channel-pricing controls: BuildRight communicates *suggested* (not mandated) resale prices to trade pros/resellers, avoids enforcing minimum resale prices or punishing discounting resellers, and uses selective-distribution criteria that are objective and non-exclusionary
Responsible (R): Legal / Trade Sales
Accountable (A): VP Legal / VP Trade Sales
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3964_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3964_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3964_Task5" name="Legal/Trade monitor trade-program conduct: trade discounts/rebates that do not…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Trade monitor trade-program conduct: trade discounts/rebates that do not function as resale-price enforcement, territory/customer assignments that do not allocate markets, and B2B special/project pricing (links to VS-11.2) that does not facilitate bid-rigging/customer allocation
Responsible (R): Legal / Trade Sales / Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Legal
