      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Channel/territory/customer-assignment decision; bid/tender process
Frequency: On decision + maintained
Volume: Trade/B2B territory and account assignments; B2G/B2B bids
Owner: VP Legal / VP Trade Sales
Participants: Legal, Trade/B2B Sales (links to VS-11), Key Account (links to VS-107), B2G (links to VS-46), Merchandising (links to VS-01)
