        <bpmn:outgoing>W3966_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3966_Task4" name="Legal/Trade establish conduct controls against market/customer allocation: no…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Trade establish conduct controls against market/customer allocation: no agreements with competitors to divide markets, customers, territories, or bids; trade-account and territory assignments made unilaterally and on objective criteria; and bid/tender participation is independent
Responsible (R): Legal / Trade Sales
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3966_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3966_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3966_Task5" name="Legal/Key-Account/B2G monitor bid conduct: no cover-pricing, bid-suppression…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Key-Account/B2G monitor bid conduct: no cover-pricing, bid-suppression, or complementary-bidding arrangements with competitors (links to VS-46 bid-rigging training and VS-86); ensure BuildRight&#x27;s B2G/B2B bids are independently prepared
Responsible (R): Legal / Key Account / B2G
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per bid</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3966_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3966_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3966_Task6" name="Legal document controls and escalate anomalies (repeated same-winner/loser…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal document controls and escalate anomalies (repeated same-winner/loser patterns, coordinated bids) to monitoring/audit (W3968) and PCC-engagement (W3969) if warranted
Responsible (R): Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3966_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3966_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
