    <bpmn:process id="W_W3967" name="W3967. Merger, Acquisition &amp; Joint-Venture Notification (PCC Pre-Filing) Control" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Proposed M&amp;A/JV meeting PCC notification thresholds (links to VS-130)
Frequency: Per transaction
Volume: Occasional (growth-stage company)
Owner: VP Legal / Corp Dev
Participants: Legal, Corp Dev (links to VS-130), Finance (links to VS-17.4/VS-40), Tax (links to VS-79), Strategy (links to VS-33), affected business unit
Source: workflow W3967 — Merger, Acquisition &amp; Joint-Venture Notification (PCC Pre-Filing) Control</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3967_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3967_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3967_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3967_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3967_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3967_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3967_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
