      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3967_Start3" name="Proposed M&amp;A/JV meeting PCC notification thresholds (links to VS-130)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3967_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3967_Task4" name="Legal/Corp-Dev assess notifiability of every proposed acquisition, merger, JV…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Corp-Dev assess notifiability of every proposed acquisition, merger, JV, or asset purchase against PCC thresholds (transaction-value and turnover thresholds in the PCC Rules for Mergers and Acquisitions, as updated), and determine the notification timeline (mandatory pre-notification within 30 days of agreement)
Responsible (R): Legal / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3967_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3967_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3967_Task5" name="Legal prepare and file the PCC notification (Form 1 and supporting documents —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal prepare and file the PCC notification (Form 1 and supporting documents — parties, transaction, market definition, overlaps, competitive effects, efficiencies), manage the review period (Phase 1 / Phase 2), and respond to PCC requests for information
Responsible (R): Legal / Corp Dev / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3967_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3967_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3967_Task6" name="Legal manage gun-jumping risk (no closing/coordination before clearance)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal manage gun-jumping risk (no closing/coordination before clearance), conditions/remedies if offered, and post-clearance compliance; coordinate with foreign filings where the target/BuildRight&#x27;s B2B customers trigger extraterritorial review
Responsible (R): Legal / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per transaction + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3967_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3967_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3967_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3967_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
