    <bpmn:process id="W_W3968" name="W3968. Competition Compliance Monitoring, Audit &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monitoring cadence; audit plan (links to VS-21); incident; regulatory change
Frequency: Continuous + periodic audit
Volume: Enterprise monitoring across all controls
Owner: VP Legal / Internal Audit
Participants: Legal, Compliance, Internal Audit (links to VS-21), the business compliance partners, Data/Analytics (links to VS-28)
Source: workflow W3968 — Competition Compliance Monitoring, Audit &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3968_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3968_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3968_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3968_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3968_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3968_Lane2" name="Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3968_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3968_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3968_Start4" name="Monitoring cadence; audit plan (links to VS-21); incident; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3968_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3968_Task5" name="Legal/Compliance run continuous monitoring: pricing-decision records (W3961)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Compliance run continuous monitoring: pricing-decision records (W3961), contract-clause review pass rate (W3962), association-meeting reports (W3965), bid-conduct signals (W3966), and platform-conduct (W3959); use analytics (links to VS-28) to detect anomalies (e.g., suspicious pricing parallelism, coordinated-bid patterns)
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3968_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3968_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3968_Task6" name="Internal Audit/Legal run periodic competition-compliance audits (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Internal Audit/Legal run periodic competition-compliance audits (links to VS-21.1) on high-risk processes and entities, test control effectiveness, and report findings to the Audit Committee
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / Legal
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3968_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3968_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3968_Task7" name="Legal/Compliance close gaps, update controls and training (W3960), and track…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal/Compliance close gaps, update controls and training (W3960), and track continuous-improvement KPIs into board reporting (W3976)
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3968_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3968_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3968_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3968_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3968_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-618 (ensure controlled execution — Anti-Competitive Conduct Prevention &amp; Compliance Controls (PA-129.2).) | - operational: analytics and audit coverage; operational: tracking and Audit Committee oversight
Owner: VP Legal / Internal Audit</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
